    "title": "Cat World Music",
    "description": "Looking for games with super cute cats?\r\nCat Music World will transport you to a colorful world where you can interact, care for lovely cats, and enjoy moments of relaxation and fun.\r\nRelaxing cat game is for all ages, especially cat lovers all over the world.\r\n\r\nEnjoy endless hours of fun with your favorite cat by participating in various game modes.\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for a game that mixes cute cats with a piano game, plays piano online, and is simple, fun, and clean, Cat Music World\u00a0is the game for you.\r\n\r\nThe game features:\r\n- Relaxing ASMR Sound and BGM\r\n- Relieve your stress by listening to the chilling sounds\u266c\r\n- Everybody can play their favorite songs: original, classic, anime, KPOP, Eng POP, EDM, Vocal... by simple and update frequently.\r\n- Play fun and addictive mini-games\r\n- Compete in the leaderboard for very exclusive rewards\r\n\r\nIf you enjoy it, download the game now!\r\n\r\nSupport:\r\nAny problems? Send feedback to us: wingsmob@outlook.com or in the game by going to Settings > FAQ and Support.\r\n\r\nTerms of use: https://wingsmob.net/terms-of-use.html\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://wingsmob.net/privacy-policy.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for games with super cute cats?<br>Cat Music World will transport you to a colorful world where you can interact, care for lovely cats, and enjoy moments of relaxation and fun.<br>Relaxing cat game is for all ages, especially cat lovers all over the world.<br><br>Enjoy endless hours of fun with your favorite cat by participating in various game modes.<br><br>If you&#39;re looking for a game that mixes cute cats with a piano game, plays piano online, and is simple, fun, and clean, Cat Music World\u00a0is the game for you.<br><br>The game features:<br>- Relaxing ASMR Sound and BGM<br>- Relieve your stress by listening to the chilling sounds\u266c<br>- Everybody can play their favorite songs: original, classic, anime, KPOP, Eng POP, EDM, Vocal... by simple and update frequently.<br>- Play fun and addictive mini-games<br>- Compete in the leaderboard for very exclusive rewards<br><br>If you enjoy it, download the game now!<br><br>Support:<br>Any problems? Send feedback to us: wingsmob@outlook.com or in the game by going to Settings &gt; FAQ and Support.<br><br>Terms of use: https://wingsmob.net/terms-of-use.html<br>Privacy Policy: https://wingsmob.net/privacy-policy.html",
